      "id": "false_front-brief-03",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "No strike on a rumor. Put our squad on the two observation points, move the three civilian vehicles toward shelter, and be ready to turn when we know where the ambush is.",
